The S11: Lobby Waiting Room story is now complete. Here's a summary of what was implemented:

**Files Created:**
- `convex/games.ts` - games.start mutation and getCurrent query
- `src/app/lobby/[code]/LobbyPageContent.tsx` - Full lobby page UI
- `src/app/lobby/[code]/page.tsx` - Client-side wrapper with dynamic import
- `src/components/lobby/PlayerList.tsx` - Player list with online status indicators
- `src/components/lobby/SettingsPanel.tsx` - Host-only settings configuration
- `src/components/lobby/StartGameButton.tsx` - Host-only start game button
- `src/lib/session.ts` - Session ID management
- `src/lib/hooks/use-session-id.ts` - Session ID React hook

**Files Modified:**
- `convex/lobbies.ts` - Added updateSettings mutation

**Features Implemented:**
- Lobby page showing lobby code with copy/share functionality
- Player list displaying all players with online status (green indicator)
- Settings panel (host only) with game configuration options
- Start game button (host only) requiring 2+ players
- Real-time updates via Convex subscriptions
- Client-side only rendering to avoid SSR Convex issues
- Redirect to home for invalid/non-existent lobbies
<promise>COMPLETE</promise>
